ing Consumer Banking, Business Banking and J.P. Morgan Wealth Management), Home Lending (including Home Lending Production, Home Lending Servicing and Real Estate Portfolios) and Card Services & Auto. Banking & Wealth Management offers deposit, investment and lending products, cash management, payments and services. Home Lending includes mortgage origination and servicing activities, as well as portfolios consisting of residential mortgages and home equity loans. Card Services issues credit cards and offers payment solutions, travel services, merchant offers and lifestyle benefits. Auto originates and services auto loans and leases.","sentences":[4,9]},{"passage_id":"0001628280-26-008131:7:88","accession":"0001628280-26-008131","item":"7","char_start":295518,"char_end":295919,"quote":"Asset Management Offers multi-asset investment management solutions across equities, fixed income, alternatives and money market funds to institutional and retail investors providing for a broad range of clients' investment needs. Global Private Bank Provides retirement products and services, brokerage, custody, estate planning, lending, deposits and investment management to high net worth clients.","sentences":[5,6]}],"searches":[{"queries":["principal products services","how we generate revenue","segments","customers","business model"],"items":["1"],"seeded":true,"passage_ids":["0001628280-26-008131:1:4","0001628280-26-008131:1:5","0001628280-26-008131:1:22","0001628280-26-008131:1:3"]},{"queries":["Business Segment & Corporate Results products services revenue"],"items":["7"],"seeded":false,"passage_ids":["0001628280-26-008131:7:49","0001628280-26-008131:7:72","0001628280-26-008131:7:48","0001628280-26-008131:7:56"]},{"queries":["Asset & Wealth Management products services customers revenue"],"items":["7"],"seeded":false,"passage_ids":["0001628280-26-008131:7:88","0001628280-26-008131:7:56","0001628280-26-008131:7:49","0001628280-26-008131:7:368"]}],"llm_calls":4,"tool_calls":4,"stop_reason":"submitted","usage":{"prompt_tokens":11063,"completion_tokens":313,"total_tokens":11376,"reasoning_tokens":0},"actual_cost_usd":0.0,"notional_cost_usd":0.0032352500000000003},"critic_status":"passed_after_retry"},{"finding":{"criterion":"durable_competitive_advantage","verdict":"insufficient evidence","rationale":"The filing discusses competitive pressures and the risk of losing market share to competitors, but it does not provide concrete evidence of a durable competitive advantage such as a quantified market share, exclusive franchise, or specific scale-based cost position that protects profits.","citations":[],"searches":[{"queries":["competition competitive","brand","market share","pricing power price increases","switching costs","patents intellectual property","scale cost advantage","network"],"items":["1","1A"],"seeded":true,"passage_ids":["0001628280-26-008131:1A:77","0001628280-26-008131:1A:83","0001628280-26-008131:1A:75","0001628280-26-008131:1A:74"]},{"queries":["market share rank scale size"],"items":["1"],"seeded":false,"passage_ids":["0001628280-26-008131:1:15","0001628280-26-008131:1:29","0001628280-26-008131:1:39","0001628280-26-008131:1:10"]}],"llm_calls":2,"tool_calls":3,"stop_reason":"submitted","usage":{"prompt_tokens":5696,"completion_tokens":141,"total_tokens":5837,"reasoning_tokens":0},"actual_cost_usd":0.0,"notional_cost_usd":0.0016355},"critic_status":"passed"},{"finding":{"criterion":"candid_management","verdict":"evidence weak","rationale":"The filing describes a structured process where the company evaluates its control environment to identify where controls have failed and where remediation is required. However, the 10-K is a limited guide to candour, as it provides these descriptions as part of a standard risk management framework rather than as a candid, retrospective account of specific management-attributed setbacks or mistakes.","citations":[{"passage_id":"0001628280-26-008131:7:313","accession":"0001628280-26-008131","item":"7","char_start":542291,"char_end":542636,"quote":"The Firm utilizes a structured risk and control self-assessment process that is executed by the LOBs and Corporate. As part of this process, the LOBs and Corporate evaluate the effectiveness of their respective control environment to assess circumstances in which controls have failed, and to determine where remediation efforts may be required.","sentences":[1,2]}],"searches":[{"queries":["challenges","did not meet","below our expectations","we did not achieve","lessons","write-down of our investment","impairment","material weakness","restatement","decline decreased","we expect headwinds"],"items":["7","1A"],"seeded":true,"passage_ids":["0001628280-26-008131:7:299","0001628280-26-008131:1A:43","0001628280-26-008131:1A:72","0001628280-26-008131:1A:70"]},{"queries":["\"we\" \"our\" \"mistake\" \"setback\" \"failed\" \"inaccurate\" \"error\""],"items":["7"],"seeded":false,"passage_ids":["0001628280-26-008131:7:110","0001628280-26-008131:7:123","0001628280-26-008131:7:313","0001628280-26-008131:7:311"]}],"llm_calls":2,"tool_calls":3,"stop_reason":"submitted","usage":{"prompt_tokens":6171,"completion_tokens":182,"total_tokens":6353,"reasoning_tokens":0},"actual_cost_usd":0.0,"notional_cost_usd":0.00181575},"critic_status":"passed"},{"finding":{"criterion":"rational_capital_allocation","verdict":"evidence found","rationale":"The filing quantifies capital actions including common share repurchases and dividend payments, and explains that these are managed under a governance framework that considers factors such as capital position, organic capital generation, and investment opportunities.","citations":[{"passage_id":"0001628280-26-008131:7:35","accession":"0001628280-26-008131","item":"7","char_start":240020,"char_end":240147,"quote":"•the impact of capital actions, including net repurchases of common shares and dividend payments on common and preferred stock.","sentences":[7,7]},{"passage_id":"0001628280-26-008131:7:160","accession":"0001628280-26-008131","item":"7","char_start":375127,"char_end":375769,"quote":"The Board of Directors' authorization to repurchase common shares is utilized at management's discretion. The common share repurchase program approved by the Board of Directors does not establish specific price targets or timetables. Management determines the amount and timing of common share repurchases based on various factors, including market conditions; legal and regulatory considerations affecting the amount and timing of repurchase activity; the Firm's capital position (taking into account goodwill and intangibles); organic capital generation; current and proposed future capital requirements; and other investment opportunities.","sentences":[1,3]}],"searches":[{"queries":["share repurchases buyback","dividends","acquisitions","capital expenditures","return on invested capital","debt reduction"],"items":["7"],"seeded":true,"passage_ids":["0001628280-26-008131:7:35","0001628280-26-008131:7:158","0001628280-26-008131:7:274","0001628280-26-008131:7:160"]}],"llm_calls":5,"tool_calls":7,"stop_reason":"submitted","usage":{"prompt_tokens":16219,"completion_tokens":777,"total_tokens":16996,"reasoning_tokens":0},"actual_cost_usd":0.0,"notional_cost_usd":0.00522025},"critic_status":"warning"}],"critic":{"cik":"0000019617","ticker":"JPM","checks":[{"check":"R1","item":"G1","status":"pass","detail":"","owner":"explainer","attempt":0,"kind":null,"claims":[]},{"check":"R1","item":"G2","status":"pass","detail":"","owner":"explainer","attempt":0,"kind":null,"claims":[]},{"check":"R1","item":"G3","status":"pass","detail":"","owner":"explainer","attempt":0,"kind":null,"claims":[]},{"check":"R1","item":"G4","status":"pass","detail":"","owner":"explainer","attempt":0,"kind":null,"claims":[]},{"check":"R1","item":"G5","status":"pass","detail":"","owner":"explainer","attempt":0,"kind":null,"claims":[]},{"check":"R1","item":"G6","status":"pass","detail":"","owner":"explainer","attempt":0,"